  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide conflict-affected girls and boys and caregivers sheltering in internally displaced persons (IDP) sites and surrounding host communities  with access to comprehensive child protection in emergencies programming, including PSS, case management, family tracing and reunification, awareness raising, and positive parenting programming</narrative>
  </description>
